sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Analyst as Analyst / Agent
    participant DOH as DoH Resolver
    participant RDAP as RDAP Server
    participant ThreatDB as Threat Intel API

    Analyst->>DOH: Query A/AAAA/MX/TXT records
    DOH-->>Analyst: Return DNS answers + TTL
    
    Analyst->>RDAP: Lookup domain registration
    RDAP-->>Analyst: Return registrar & contact info
    
    Analyst->>ThreatDB: Check reputation / IoC hits
    ThreatDB-->>Analyst: Return pulse / report data
